@page "/"

<h3>Day 8 Demonstration -- Cart Persistence</h3>

<div class="alert alert-info">
    <h5>What this demonstration shows</h5>
    <p>
        The Day 7 cart store, now with localStorage persistence and startup
        rehydration. Add items on the <a href="/shop">Shop</a> page, refresh the
        browser, and the cart survives.
    </p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Persistence effects</strong> save the cart to localStorage after every Add / Remove / Clear.</li>
        <li><strong>Hydration</strong> restores the saved cart when the app starts.</li>
    </ul>
</div>
